37591>>>        Get Server to hoDD
37592>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
37593>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
37594>>>
37594>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
37594>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
37595>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
37596>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
