37801>>>                Case Break
37802>>>
37802>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37802>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37802>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
37802>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37803>>>
37803>>>        Case End
